{
  "id": "LeadAsstFormIn01",
  "name": "Assistant · Website form",
  "description": "Receives the business website's contact form and hands it to Ingest message.",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Website form\n**POST /webhook/form** `{ form_id, name, email, phone, message }` from the contact form on the business website. A valid submission is stored by **Ingest message** like any other message; the reply is a Gmail **draft** to the person's email (see Send message). Limits for the public site (**Config**, over 24 hours): per email address and in all, past which it answers 429.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 1100,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "b5b86769-b28f-4973-a406-c3ff6da4c598",
      "name": "Note: form",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -300
      ]
    },
